/* Hea Teruana the Gromnie Hunter - South camp hunter (Gromnie), marae-hunt.
 * Gives one random Gromnie species of the South zone, 50 kills; minimum level 100;
 * reward 400,000,000 XP (AwardNoShareXP) + 100,000 Luminance; 20 h cooldown from the claim
 * (MaraeHuntSouthGromnieWait). Skin cloned from 1003208 Hea Nyrinua the Armorer (Setup, palette, clothing, stats; never its emotes,
 * generators, books, spells, positions or hand items). Wields Chimeric Stave of the Quiddity (1004718).
 * Gender (dialogue/design only - Hea Tumerok weenies carry no gender property): Male. Skins were drawn without regard to gender; swap the template if one reads wrong in game. */

DELETE FROM `weenie` WHERE `class_Id` = 1007902;

